{"title":"World's Strongest Survivor","synopsis":"Dari Studio yang membawakan <Talent-Swallowing Magician>\n\n\"Yang bertahan hidup bukanlah yang terkuat. Yang bertahan hidup adalah yang terkuat.\"\n\nSetelah keluar dari militer, Jin Seowoon tidak melakukan apa-apa selain bermain game seperti pecundang. Suatu hari, ia diundang ke dunia bernama \"Cloyd Survival\", yang mirip dengan game yang ia sukai.\n\nDi dunia itu, terdapat para master bela diri, raja-raja dari dunia lain, dan pembunuh-pembunuh terkenal...\n\nItu adalah kumpulan monster yang melampaui imajinasi manusia.\n\nJin Seowoon hanya memiliki satu tujuan—bertahan hidup dan menjadi salah satu dari sepuluh terkuat.\n\nInilah kisah perjuangan hidup dan mati Jin Seowoon.","alternative_title":"서바이벌로 세계 최강","author":"Yobi","artist":"Eorin Haku, Inoan","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"c8467c17-44bb-4002-a5f3-90cbf71005cf","number":"38","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-05-06","images":[]},{"id":"7a78846c-eafb-4cd2-973b-aeec72f0cba8","number":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-05-03","images":[]},{"id":"785c620d-1e0a-446a-bc62-9bd41f745cdb","number":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-05-03","images":[]},{"id":"e7451879-c246-4abf-877e-5cffc1fd934e","number":"35","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"id":"71e7f93d-b0ed-4561-b2a5-49f1e5d6a448","number":"34","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"id":"5c4f20f3-41e5-4666-b25f-06a013eab1e6","number":"33","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"2a8087e8-551c-41ed-ad10-4aa3adc58ae8","number":"32","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"c7cfb82a-4be2-486a-ba01-d24cfa4498a1","number":"31","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-04-28","images":[]},{"id":"64291dfd-1da8-4c2f-b9b3-76a2a92faf20","number":"30","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"id":"f9f99f75-92fe-41b5-ba5f-4263a44bca06","number":"29","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"id